     "args": "{\"term\":\"AEO\"}",
     "spoken": "# AEO (Answer Engine Optimisation) AEO is the practice of structuring your website so AI assistants like ChatGPT, Perplexity and Google's AI Overviews quote you when they answer a question. Where SEO chased rankings on a results page, AEO chases citations inside the answer itself. ## Why it matters A growing share of your buyers never see a results page: they ask an assistant and act on the answer. If the assistant names a competitor, or describes you wrongly, you lose the deal before you knew it existed. AEO is how you show up, accurately, in that moment.",
